provider: ollama-cloud (glm-5.3)
request: In the watchlist, show movies I haven't watched yet before the ones I've watched.

single call 10: check  (Watchlist component now renders unwatched movies before watched ones via a stable sort in a computed signal; store insertion order (and thus persistence, badge counts, and detail lookups) is untouched. Added a spec test for the new ordering (including moving a movie back to the front when un-watched) and made two existing toggle tests look up their checkbox by label instead of by row index, since Movie 1 moves to the end after being watched.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 11: accept  (The watchlist now lists unwatched movies before watched ones. The component derives its list from a stable sort (watched last) inside a computed signal, so it stays reactive when a movie is toggled, added or removed, while the store's insertion order (and therefore persistence, the nav count and detail-page lookups) is unchanged. A new spec test covers the ordering and moving a movie back to the front when marked unwatched.)

